	abstract = {This study explores the potential of AI and Blockchain technologies in transforming procurement functions such as source-to-contract, supplier relationship management, contract management, and procure-to-pay. An online survey of 87 Middle Eastern procurement professionals identified 17 benefits, including efficiency, transparency, and trust, and 11 challenges, such as costs, security, and data management. Analyzed using IBM SPSS, the findings reveal where each technology adds value. The research offers practical insights, highlights adoption hurdles, and recommends best practices to enhance digital procurement readiness, providing businesses with a roadmap to effectively implement and benefit from AI and Blockchain in procurement. © 2025 World Scientific Publishing Company.},
